    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "But our people..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "I took the L. G. D.'s tactics and equipment into consideration. Facing my herd should have delayed them at least two days. So who is it that's done this?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "People in black raincoats."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Captain!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Faust!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Crossbowmen, reform the squad! Mine and a few other teams have scooped up a lot of Mephisto's people."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Together, we can hold back the L. G. D."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Faust, Faust... are you hurt?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "(Why did you leave back there?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "...Because I had to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "And I'm glad to see how many of our people you've brought back with you. You'll put them to good use against the L. G. D. I'm sure?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "They won't attack us, but I can't control them. I've been wracking my brain over it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "There aren't many left though."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "We will need more of our people to protect us. We must defeat those L. G. D.s if we're going to escape."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Mephisto, don't use those Arts again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "But didn't you say we have to survive, Faust? Isn't that what's most important?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "...Then why did you...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Why did you say you would die for that monster, back at the L. G. D. Headquarters?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Crossbowmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Ready."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Take him."
    },
